And therefore, I think we can expand the range of markets that users can use.

229
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:48,880
I think also that this technology works 24-7 is a huge advantage.

230
00:16:48,880 --> 00:16:54,960
Traditional FX markets don't work 24-7, which is crazy for a market that size that users

231
00:16:54,960 --> 00:17:00,960
over the weekend just don't have any opportunity to hedge their FX exposure or to actually

232
00:17:01,040 --> 00:17:08,880
even see the value of their Ghanaan sedis in Euros or in any other currency over the weekend.

233
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:14,880
I think that is something where this technology can offer a lot of advantages.

234
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:20,320
And then it's also, I think, really, really interesting to see that there is not a lot

235
00:17:20,320 --> 00:17:24,960
of FX infrastructure actually already live in Web3.

236
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:31,600
There are many different platforms, many different chains out there that have a few

