240
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:50,320
And I think this is where we as Mento also can make a difference.

241
00:17:50,320 --> 00:17:58,320
We can offer better markets across all of these currencies because the traditional way

242
00:17:58,320 --> 00:18:03,600
