248
00:18:24,480 --> 00:18:30,160
And therefore, this AMM is not optimized to mirror an off-chain price.

249
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:37,360
I mentioned the amount of volume that daily flows through the, for example, Euro-dollar market.

250
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:43,360
So currently, at least, this price between the Euro and the dollar is determined off-chain.

251
00:18:43,360 --> 00:18:50,240
So what we need on-chain is actually proper infrastructure that is able to, in very high

252
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:53,600
frequencies, mimic that price of the off-chain world.

253
00:18:53,600 --> 00:18:56,160
And here, an AMM is not the proper infrastructure.

254
00:18:56,800 --> 00:19:01,840
What we have with Mento is what we call FPMMs, fixed price market makers.

255
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:06,400
In the end, pools that allow users to swap at the exchange rate.

256
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:12,560
And this is what we now have on Selo and want to bring to other networks as well.

257
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:17,600
So we want to bring this, in the end, to all major networks out there or major blockchains

258
00:19:17,600 --> 00:19:23,200
out there that have an interest in being able to offer proper FX markets.

